/T (As shown in the image above, the 7-segment display is indicating the number 9. This is because all nine sensors in the tank are activated \(each having a value of 1\), which means the water has reached and covered all the sensors. This indicates that the tank is 90% full.)
/E (As shown in the image above, the 7-segment display is indicating the number 9. This is because all nine sensors in the tank are activated \(each having a value of 1\), which means the water has reached and covered all the sensors. This indicates that the tank is 90% full.)
