<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (After deriving all the Boolean equations for the Auto Refill and Drain Control function, we implemented them in CircuitVerse using basic logic gates \(AND, NOT\). Since the simulator does not support valve components, we used LEDs to represent the valve states \(yellow for the inlet valve and green for the outlet valve\). This setup allowed us to test and verify the logic functionality effectively.)
/E (After deriving all the Boolean equations for the Auto Refill and Drain Control function, we implemented them in CircuitVerse using basic logic gates \(AND, NOT\). Since the simulator does not support valve components, we used LEDs to represent the valve states \(yellow for the inlet valve and green for the outlet valve\). This setup allowed us to test and verify the logic functionality effectively.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
